    10	//! - Slot 1: Fuel (coal, charcoal, etc.)
    11	//! - Slot 2: Output (smelted result)
    12	//!
    13	//! The screen handler tracks 4 properties:
    14	//! - Property 0: Fire icon animation (fuel burn time remaining)
    15	//! - Property 1: Maximum fuel burn time
