   215	    // `VibrationSystem.Listener.isValidVibration` rejects a source entity that
   216	    // dampens vibrations (ItemEntity.java:85-87 and VibrationSystem.java:424-426).
   217	    // Keep this source-side gate here so every listener observes the same rule.
   218	    if let Some(source) = context.source_entity.clone()
