codex
The first concrete gaps are now clear. Furnace inventory/routing, burn lookup, recipe XP extraction, and container slot behavior are already modeled or inlined at live callers. I found one real furnace gap: vanilla awards pending furnace XP from `preRemoveSideEffects`, while Pumpkin’s block-entity removal hook currently only spills inventory. I also found the chest-vehicle close path lacks vanilla’s `CONTAINER_CLOSE` event; I’m wiring both through existing live removal/screen-close hooks.
