+| Class | methods IMPLEMENTED (names) | vanilla file:lines read | BLOCKED with grep evidence |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| AbstractChestBoat | `getSinglePassengerXOffset` (shared `Entity::position_rider`); `stillValid` (`ContainerAccess::Entity`); `stopOpen` (`MinecartInventory::on_close`) | `net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/boat/AbstractChestBoat.java:42-50,108-199`; `net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/ContainerEntity.java:88-170`; `net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/boat/AbstractBoat.java:135-151` | None. `clearContent` RENAMED `MinecartInventory::clear`; `clearItemStacks`, `getContainerLootTable`, `getContainerLootTableSeed`, `getItemStacks`, `setContainerLootTable`, `setContainerLootTableSeed` DATA_MODELED by `MinecartInventory.items`/`loot_table`; `getContainerSize`, `removeItem`, `removeItemNoUpdate` RENAMED to `Inventory::size`, `remove_stack_specific`, `remove_stack`; `getMaxPassengers` INLINED as `MAX_PASSENGERS` in `ChestBoatEntity::interact`; `setChanged` RENAMED to the live `Inventory::mark_dirty` default.` |
+| AbstractFurnaceBlockEntity | `preRemoveSideEffects` (shared `BlockEntity::on_block_replaced`) | `net/minecraft/world/level/block/entity/AbstractFurnaceBlockEntity.java:247-380`; `net/minecraft/world/inventory/FurnaceResultSlot.java:23-52` | `fillStackedContents` BLOCKED: `rg -n "StackedItemContents|StackedContentsCompatible|fill_stacked_contents|fillStackedContents" crates/pumpkin crates/pumpkin-inventory crates/pumpkin-world` produced empty output. Other leads are RENAMED/INLINED/DATA_MODELED: `canPlaceItemThroughFace` -> `Inventory::can_insert_through_face`; `canTakeItemThroughFace` -> `Inventory::can_extract_through_face`; `getContainerSize` -> `Inventory::size`; `getBurnDuration` -> `pumpkin_data::fuels::get_item_burn_ticks`; `setRecipeUsed` -> `CookingBlockEntityBase::add_recipe_used`; `awardUsedRecipes`, `awardUsedRecipesAndPopExperience`, `getRecipesToAwardAndPopExperience` -> `Player::increment_stat`/`FurnaceOutputSlot::on_take_item`/`extract_experience_from_recipes`; `setItems` -> generated `items` storage and `from_nbt`.` |
